{"version":1,"content":"<p>一尾長3米的雌性鯊魚被困韓國釜山運河逾一個月後，隨着水溫下降，救援人員周三（21日）嘗試引導牠重返大海，惟牠離開水道後僅數小時又折返回運河，當局周四（22日）繼續展開新一輪引導行動。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:22:30.099020+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:32:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.673815+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:17:42.878804+00:00","content_hash":"29a6c38f2612b82be1cb0a57b1c968b4ee45e1cbe49af143b3917e989b330ca4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}